{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIzL011cmRlci1Jcy1FYXN5LSUyODIwMjMtJTI5Lw","type":"series","name":"Murder Is Easy","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/4Ced0ExBzhOsEsMBdghOm0OqurG.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cBLnZD7BWzDlFwFFxK1ZxdzUWxB.jpg","description":"England, 1954. On a train to London, Fitzwilliam meets Miss Pinkerton, who tells him that a killer is on the loose in the sleepy English village of Wychwood under Ashe. The villagers believe the deaths are accidents, but Miss Pinkerton knows otherwise — and when she’s later found dead on her way to Scotland Yard, Fitzwilliam feels he must find the killer before they can strike again.\n\nComplete series. On your server: S1 2/2","releaseInfo":"2023","genres":["Mystery","Crime","English"],"videos":[{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIzL011cmRlci1Jcy1FYXN5LSUyODIwMjMtJTI5Lw.1.1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"episode":1,"released":"2023-12-27T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"A stranger's death leads Luke Fitzwilliam to the quiet village of Wychwood, where he is determined to prove that a series of tragic 'accidents' is in fact the work of a killer.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1rwt7Evk0p3cIcPIwhtZgaBWdNS.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDIzL011cmRlci1Jcy1FYXN5LSUyODIwMjMtJTI5Lw.1.2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"episode":2,"released":"2023-12-28T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"As the village is shaken by another death, the discovery of a crucial piece of evidence blows the investigation wide open and leaves Luke Fitzwilliam questioning who he can trust.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/s0aFQeXjjXKZUX0QVoZab3JXOLJ.jpg"}],"imdbRating":"5.3","runtime":"59 min","cast":["David Jonsson","Morfydd Clark","Penelope Wilton","Sinéad Matthews","Tom Riley","Douglas Henshall","Mathew Baynton","Mark Bonnar"],"director":["Sian Ejiwunmi-Le Berre"],"